- Auth endpoints: register, login
- Market endpoints: getStocks, getStock
- Trading endpoints: buy, sell, cancel, getOrders
- Portfolio endpoints: getPortfolio, getSummary
- History endpoints: getTrades, getDaily
- SSEManager class for real-time stock price updates via EventSource

**web/src/types.ts**
- StockData: code, name, current_price, change, volume, etc.
- StockDetail: extends StockData with history array
- OrderData: id, stock_code, direction, quantity, price, status
- PositionData: stock holdings with cost basis and P&L
- PortfolioSummary: total assets, balance, market value, P&L
- TradeRecord: completed trades with details
- DailyAsset: date and total assets tracking

### Components (web/src/components/)

**SSEStatus.tsx**
- Shows connection status indicator (green/red circle)
- Displays "实时" (real-time) or "断开" (disconnected)

**Navbar.tsx**
- Navigation bar with links to Market, Portfolio, History
- Displays username and logout button
- Highlights current route

**Layout.tsx**
- Main layout wrapper with Navbar
- Sets up page container with styling

**PriceChart.tsx**
- AreaChart from Recharts for stock price history
- Dynamic gradient colors (red for up, green for down)
- Y-axis domain calculation with 10% padding

**AssetChart.tsx**
- LineChart showing daily asset total over time
- Y-axis formatted in tens of thousands (万)
- Orange stroke color

**StockTable.tsx**
- Table displaying all stocks with:
  - Code, Name, Current Price, Change, Change %, Volume
  - Clickable rows for navigation
  - Red/green coloring for up/down movements

**OrderList.tsx**
- Table showing pending/filled/cancelled orders
  - Stock, Direction (buy/sell), Quantity, Price, Status
  - Cancel button for pending orders

**TradeTable.tsx**
- Table of completed trades with:
  - Time, Stock Code, Direction, Quantity, Price, Amount
  - Formatted timestamps and currency

**PortfolioTable.tsx**
- Holdings table with:
  - Stock, Quantity, Cost Basis, Current Price, Market Value, P&L
  - P&L shown in red (positive) or green (negative)

### Pages (web/src/pages/)

**Login.tsx**
- Login form with username and password fields
- Link to register page
- Redirects to home on successful login

**Register.tsx**
- Registration form with validation
  - Username: min 2 characters
  - Password: min 4 characters
- Shows initial balance on success

**Market.tsx**
- Displays StockTable with all stocks
- Clicking row navigates to stock detail page

**Portfolio.tsx**
- Summary cards: Total Assets, Available Balance, Total Market Value, Total P&L
- PortfolioTable with all positions
- AssetChart showing portfolio value over time
- All data loaded on component mount

**History.tsx**
- Trade history with filtering by stock
- Pagination with 20 items per page
- Stock dropdown filter

**StockDetail.tsx**
- Detailed stock view with:
  - Stock price display with change indicators
  - Price chart with 60-point history
  - Buy/Sell order forms with quantity and price inputs
  - Order list for the stock
  - Real-time price updates from SSE
  - Balance and position display

### Hooks (web/src/hooks/)

**useAuth.ts**
- AuthContext provider for authentication state
- Stores token and username in localStorage
- Provides login/logout functions
- useAuth hook for consuming auth context

**useSSE.ts**
- Connects to SSEManager on mount
- Maintains stocks and connection status state
- Cleanup on unmount to prevent memory leaks

